==== RJ45 socket DIY modification ====

If the ethernet plugs will not latch properly into the RJ45 sockets, the solution is to modify the case as shown below\\
{{media:xiaomi:4ag_rj45mod.jpg?400|}}\\
To prevent accidental damage to the 'fragile' blue & black RJ45 sockets, the PCB can be slid slightly to one side, and the 
 sockets taped over to block dust.  Use a square file to carefully carve out the notch in the white ABS case.

The ethernet cables will latch into the RJ45 sockets with a positive and Loud click.

